IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `moco-rules`

§ `Tests`

o1 MEANS `Attachment order` OF Date 1 3 2020, 300
o2 MEANS `Attachment order` OF Date 1 6 2021, 400
o3 MEANS `Attachment order` OF Date 1 1 2019, 200

#ASSERT `the amounts paid under each order for` (`Attachment case` OF TRUE, 1000, (LIST o1, o2)) EQUALS JUST (LIST 300, 400)
#ASSERT `the amounts paid under each order for` (`Attachment case` OF TRUE, 500, (LIST o1, o2)) EQUALS JUST (LIST 300, 200)
-- Out of order: the 2019 order is paid first.
#ASSERT `the amounts paid under each order for` (`Attachment case` OF TRUE, 600, (LIST o1, o2, o3)) EQUALS JUST (LIST 200, 300, 100)
#ASSERT `the amounts paid under each order for` (`Attachment case` OF TRUE, 100, (LIST o1, o3)) EQUALS JUST (LIST 100, 0)
#ASSERT `the amounts paid under each order for` (`Attachment case` OF FALSE, 1000, (LIST o1)) EQUALS NOTHING
